Package: plasma-claude-usage
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), plasma-framework
Description: Plasma panel widget with the remaining Claude subscription limit
 Shows how much of the Claude subscription limit is left (5-hour and weekly
 windows) and when it resets. The numbers come from Claude Code, which passes
 them to its status line command: set "claude-usage record" as the status
 line in ~/.claude/settings.json.
